      "content": "i mean i'm a grown adult i can figure it out lol. i just don't want to waste time and money on an urgent care visit if i'm just slightly dehydrated from the herbs. if i just drink way more electrolytes and maybe take an extra dose of my metformin to balance it out, i should be fine to just sleep it off tonight right?",
