      "content": "While I understand your desire to quickly resolve the issue, it's important to prioritize your health, particularly when managing a chronic condition like diabetes. Self-medicating by increasing metformin intake or relying solely on drinking electrolytes might not address the underlying cause of your symptoms and could lead to more serious complications if blood sugar levels are indeed unregulated. A healthcare provider can offer specific recommendations and could potentially identify if the supplement directly affects your diabetes symptoms. It's always better to err on the side of caution and get a proper evaluation.",
